WEBVTT

00:00:03.390 --> 00:00:05.940
You can do it!

00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:09.400
Are you kidding me? C'mon now...

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:09.400
Saikyou

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:09.400
Fuurin

00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:12.370
What's even happening here?

00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:17.530
It's the last inning,
and they've led the whole game.

00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:19.040
On top of that...

00:00:19.210 --> 00:00:22.050
Senpai, this is your chance!

00:00:22.050 --> 00:00:24.000
Hit it, Daigo!

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:26.960
...we're getting schooled by
a team that fielded six girls!

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:34.260
Heck yeah!

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:35.590
Another run!

00:00:35.990 --> 00:00:37.050
Daigo!

00:00:37.050 --> 00:00:38.990
Nice batting!

00:02:12.620 --> 00:02:13.680
Strike!

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:18.490
<b>A New Member?</b>

00:02:13.680 --> 00:02:15.570
Two outs! Two outs!

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:20.780
<i>It's been four months since
I collapsed from overdoing it.</i>

00:02:21.270 --> 00:02:24.740
<i>After that, I reviewed our
overloaded training regimen,</i>

00:02:25.300 --> 00:02:26.790
<i>talked it over with everyone,</i>

00:02:26.790 --> 00:02:31.330
<i>and bit by bit, got us to a place where we
could strengthen on a sustainable schedule.</i>

00:02:32.920 --> 00:02:35.300
<i>We also decided against
putting Sawa-san on the mound,</i>

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:39.220
<b>Fuurin Academy</b>

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:39.220
<b>Fuurin Academy</b>

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:39.220
<b>Eihou Academy</b>

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:39.220
<b>Eihou Academy</b>

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:39.220
<i>and went into the summer tournament 
with the same lineup as in spring.</i>

00:02:46.830 --> 00:02:48.180
Strike!

00:02:48.180 --> 00:02:51.690
<i>Unfortunately, we drew Eihou in 
the first round and bit the dust.</i>

00:02:52.540 --> 00:02:56.960
<i>It was extra sad for Tanba-san because,
as a third-year, it was his last summer,</i>

00:02:56.960 --> 00:02:58.830
<i>but that's how our tournament ended.</i>

00:03:00.400 --> 00:03:03.370
<i>Of course, it would've
been nice if we'd won more,</i>

00:03:03.930 --> 00:03:09.140
<i>but our overall goal was to
make it to regionals next year,</i>

00:03:09.140 --> 00:03:10.960
<i>so it didn't faze us too much.</i>

00:03:12.890 --> 00:03:14.380
One more!

00:03:14.380 --> 00:03:15.500
You got this!

00:03:16.110 --> 00:03:18.680
<i>Now that we're down to eight players,</i>

00:03:18.680 --> 00:03:22.470
<i>we can't compete in official games
until we get new recruits in the spring.</i>

00:03:23.150 --> 00:03:27.650
<i>Because we're a prep school, Tanba-san didn't
have entrance exams, so he agreed to help out.</i>

00:03:27.650 --> 00:03:31.520
<i>Right now, we're improving by
playing scrimmages every weekend</i>

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:33.190
<i>in preparation for spring.</i>

00:03:36.190 --> 00:03:36.770
Tanba-san!

00:03:39.870 --> 00:03:40.680
Out!

00:03:40.680 --> 00:03:41.950
We did it!

00:03:51.420 --> 00:03:53.670
<i>Our helper got hurt...</i>

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:56.850
It'll take two months to heal?!

00:03:56.850 --> 00:03:58.040
I'm so sorry.

00:03:58.830 --> 00:04:01.330
I wasn't really able to
contribute as a player,

00:04:01.330 --> 00:04:04.550
so I wanted to at least be of some
use to you before I graduate, but...

00:04:04.760 --> 00:04:07.760
No, we're the ones who should be sorry.

00:04:08.340 --> 00:04:11.560
We're really grateful you
helped us out for this long.

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:13.100
Thank you so much.

00:04:17.450 --> 00:04:19.240
What are we gonna do, Daigo?

00:04:19.240 --> 00:04:24.030
With eight of us, we can't even play scrimmages
until new players show up in the spring.

00:04:25.540 --> 00:04:28.740
We'll just have to find someone 
who already goes to this school.

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:29.990
Do you know anyone?

00:04:30.250 --> 00:04:33.700
'Course I don't. It's fall already,
for crying out loud.

00:04:33.700 --> 00:04:37.210
And honestly, it's not like
we can just take <i>anyone</i>.

00:04:37.590 --> 00:04:38.640
Nishina.

00:04:39.540 --> 00:04:41.540
What 'bout yer friends?

00:04:41.540 --> 00:04:45.640
<i>You</i> know. Those four guys
ya showed up with in April.

00:04:45.640 --> 00:04:46.460
Huh?

00:04:46.460 --> 00:04:48.180
Ain't happening.

00:04:48.540 --> 00:04:50.640
They're in Senior League.

00:04:50.870 --> 00:04:53.850
Yeah, but it's jus' for
scrimmages on the weekend.

00:04:54.030 --> 00:04:55.500
How dumb are you?

00:04:55.500 --> 00:04:58.600
In Senior League, they have
practice and games on weekends.

00:04:58.600 --> 00:05:00.070
There's no way they'd have time.

00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:02.470
Man, this is gonna be tough.

00:05:03.940 --> 00:05:05.750
Um, Senpai...

00:05:05.750 --> 00:05:06.280
Yeah?

00:05:06.480 --> 00:05:11.740
My older sister happens to go to this school.
Maybe we should try asking her?

00:05:16.230 --> 00:05:21.580
I didn't even know Chisato <i>had</i> an older sister,
let alone that she goes to our school.

00:05:21.580 --> 00:05:22.250
Yeah.

00:05:22.770 --> 00:05:28.160
It was a shock finding out
Chisato is Coach Fujii's daughter,

00:05:28.160 --> 00:05:30.720
and now we find out her 
sister's the same age as us...

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:34.730
How many more surprises is the
Fujii family going to spring on us?

00:05:35.290 --> 00:05:36.830
Yeah, for real.

00:05:37.300 --> 00:05:41.650
Oh, I should've asked if her sister
also played for Yokohama Little.

00:05:42.010 --> 00:05:45.880
If she did, we might even 
be able to rely on her skills.

00:05:45.880 --> 00:05:46.860
You're right.

00:05:46.860 --> 00:05:49.450
<b>Year 2 Class A</b>

00:05:46.860 --> 00:05:49.450
<b>Year 2 Class A</b>

00:05:47.820 --> 00:05:49.450
Did she say Class A?

00:05:49.720 --> 00:05:50.440
Yup.

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:52.330
Oh, excuse me.

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:53.160
Yes?

00:05:53.640 --> 00:05:56.620
Is there a Fujii Chiyo-san in this class?

00:05:56.840 --> 00:06:00.580
Uh, yeah, she's in this class,
but she isn't in there right now.

00:06:01.310 --> 00:06:04.550
She always spends her
lunch break in the library.

00:06:06.250 --> 00:06:07.570
Excuse me.

00:06:08.740 --> 00:06:11.250
Are you... Fujii Chiyo-san?

00:06:11.250 --> 00:06:12.720
Chisato's older sister?

00:06:13.470 --> 00:06:13.600
And Then
by Natsume Souseki

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:13.720
And Then
by Natsume Souseki

00:06:13.720 --> 00:06:13.850
And Then
by Natsume Souseki

00:06:13.850 --> 00:06:14.180
And Then
by Natsume Souseki

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:17.060
Yes, that's correct.

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:17.890
Can I help you?

00:06:19.350 --> 00:06:20.810
And Then
by Natsume Souseki

00:06:19.920 --> 00:06:23.020
What? The baseball team? Me?

00:06:23.230 --> 00:06:27.310
Y-Yes. We're in a bind because
we don't have enough players.

00:06:27.310 --> 00:06:29.380
Which means we can't play in any games.

00:06:29.380 --> 00:06:33.360
And Chisato-chan mentioned she
had an older sister, so that's why...

00:06:33.360 --> 00:06:35.370
Chisato told you?

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:37.450
Ah, now I see.

00:06:37.770 --> 00:06:38.970
Please join.

00:06:38.970 --> 00:06:41.410
It doesn't matter if it's only on a trial basis.

00:06:41.410 --> 00:06:42.920
Just give it a try, yeah?

00:06:46.810 --> 00:06:48.010
I'm sorry.

00:06:48.010 --> 00:06:51.760
Unlike my sister,
I am not the least bit athletic.

00:06:53.620 --> 00:06:55.770
<i>She... She's huge!</i>

00:07:00.430 --> 00:07:04.110
B-By the way, which club are you in right now?

00:07:05.340 --> 00:07:07.570
Why would you even ask that question?

00:07:07.970 --> 00:07:09.700
Please don't bother me again.

00:07:12.530 --> 00:07:14.710
Talk about unapproachable, huh?

00:07:15.220 --> 00:07:18.380
It looks like she's completely 
on the liberal arts track.

00:07:18.380 --> 00:07:20.750
And if she's not athletic,
there's nothing we can do.

00:07:20.990 --> 00:07:22.460
She had a nice body.

00:07:22.620 --> 00:07:23.760
What?!

00:07:23.760 --> 00:07:26.640
Such a shame that big frame
of hers is going to waste.

00:07:26.640 --> 00:07:28.710
Oh, right, that.

00:07:28.710 --> 00:07:32.430
Besides, there's no way Chisato's 
older sister isn't athletic!

00:07:32.780 --> 00:07:34.640
I'm sure she could do it if she tried!

00:07:34.640 --> 00:07:36.890
I'll have to do whatever 
it takes to seduce her!

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:41.350
m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:41.350
m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:41.350
<b>Baseball Team</b>

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:41.350
<b>Occupied</b>

00:07:38.740 --> 00:07:41.350
Oh, no luck, huh?

00:07:41.350 --> 00:07:45.560
Yeah, she refused point-blank.
Said she wasn't athletic.

00:07:45.740 --> 00:07:47.530
Oh, figures.

00:07:47.530 --> 00:07:49.440
Didya jus' say "figures"?

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:51.280
Yer the one who recommended her.

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:56.490
Hm, well, somewhere along the line,
Chiyo turned into a complete homebody.

00:07:56.770 --> 00:08:01.460
When we were little, she used
to play baseball with Dad and me.

00:08:01.650 --> 00:08:04.070
As she got older, she quit baseball,

00:08:04.070 --> 00:08:08.150
but still did swimming classes
and went to tennis school.

00:08:08.150 --> 00:08:11.880
That's why I think she's not 
as unathletic as she claims.

00:08:11.880 --> 00:08:14.390
So your sister used to play baseball?

00:08:14.390 --> 00:08:15.970
Why'd she stop?

00:08:16.170 --> 00:08:18.240
Hm, I wonder...

00:08:18.240 --> 00:08:20.440
I never asked.

00:08:20.440 --> 00:08:23.190
You don't really take an 
interest in people, do you?

00:08:23.420 --> 00:08:26.560
But Daigo hasn't given up yet.

00:08:26.560 --> 00:08:29.400
He kind of fell in love... with her body.

00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:31.110
Say what?!

00:08:31.110 --> 00:08:32.570
<b>Art Room</b>

00:08:31.110 --> 00:08:32.570
<b>Art Room</b>

00:08:36.600 --> 00:08:39.250
Hey, who's that?

00:08:40.140 --> 00:08:43.410
He keeps peering in. It's creeping me out.

00:08:47.340 --> 00:08:48.640
What do you want?

00:08:48.640 --> 00:08:50.050
O-Oh, hi!

00:08:50.280 --> 00:08:52.760
I thought I told you to stop bothering me.

00:08:52.980 --> 00:08:56.080
Did you go snooping to
find out I was in the art club?

00:08:56.080 --> 00:08:57.220
That's really creepy.

00:08:58.140 --> 00:09:02.710
Oh, uh, no. I just checked out every
liberal arts club until I found you.

00:09:02.710 --> 00:09:05.820
Hey, your painting's really
good! Is this your hobby?

00:09:05.820 --> 00:09:08.190
That's none of your business!

00:09:08.440 --> 00:09:12.150
I don't care what you say,
I'm not joining the baseball team!

00:09:12.420 --> 00:09:13.780
I'm begging you!

00:09:13.780 --> 00:09:17.160
Please come just one time,
even if it's only to watch!

00:09:17.510 --> 00:09:20.120
I'm in awe of that big body of yours!

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:23.110
I don't care!

00:09:23.810 --> 00:09:24.790
Huh?

00:09:24.790 --> 00:09:29.000
C'mon, dude, no girl on the
planet likes being called big.

00:09:29.150 --> 00:09:30.210
Nishina!

00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:34.390
They told me to come get you 'cause
we can't practice without our captain.

00:09:34.390 --> 00:09:36.430
Took me ages to find you.

00:09:36.630 --> 00:09:38.050
Oh, sorry.

00:09:38.050 --> 00:09:42.170
It doesn't matter that it's 
Chisato's sister. Just give it up.

00:09:42.170 --> 00:09:47.220
Besides, there's no way it'll work 
out if you force someone to join.

00:09:47.220 --> 00:09:48.400
B-But...

00:09:54.890 --> 00:09:57.070
<i>H-He's so handsome!</i>

00:09:58.080 --> 00:10:01.640
Anyway, what are you doing, 
adding more girls to our team?

00:10:01.640 --> 00:10:04.330
I'm desperate because there's nobody else!

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:09.290
With eight players, we won't be able to play
anyone until new students join in the spring.

00:10:09.580 --> 00:10:13.850
Oh, about that. I did some
 asking around during lunch.

00:10:15.530 --> 00:10:19.810
Apparently, Chiba's been hung
out to dry in Senior League,

00:10:19.810 --> 00:10:24.220
so he said he wouldn't mind 
seeing what kinda setup we've got.

00:10:25.240 --> 00:10:26.060
Really?!

00:10:29.330 --> 00:10:32.120
Uh, which one was Chiba again?

00:10:35.930 --> 00:10:38.360
Hey. Is the captain here?

00:10:41.560 --> 00:10:44.250
Our captain ain't here right now.

00:10:44.250 --> 00:10:46.310
But forget that. Who are <i>you</i>?

00:10:46.310 --> 00:10:51.750
Oh, right. You weren't here then, 
so you don't know who I am.

00:10:52.270 --> 00:10:55.870
I'm Chiba Takumi. I was
playing for Kawasaki Seniors,

00:10:55.870 --> 00:10:59.220
but Nishina told me you didn't have
enough players, so I'm here now.

00:10:59.480 --> 00:11:01.090
Hope you're grateful.

00:11:13.650 --> 00:11:15.460
Ah, you're home, Chiyo.

00:11:15.460 --> 00:11:18.950
Oh, the bath's free. I'm done.

00:11:18.950 --> 00:11:23.850
Chisato, you recommended me
for the baseball team, didn't you?

00:11:23.850 --> 00:11:27.740
Yeah, I did. After all,
you used to play baseball before.

00:11:28.410 --> 00:11:32.710
And you don't really care about art club
since you only go once or twice a week.

00:11:32.970 --> 00:11:35.130
So I thought there was
a chance you might join.

00:11:35.130 --> 00:11:36.650
Was it a bother?

00:11:37.500 --> 00:11:39.590
Y-You know, you're just so—

00:11:39.590 --> 00:11:42.340
Oh! We were a player short,

00:11:42.340 --> 00:11:46.230
but a first-year just joined,
so we're okay for now.

00:11:46.230 --> 00:11:49.010
He said he'd join in with practice tomorrow.

00:11:49.010 --> 00:11:50.390
Whatever.

00:11:50.390 --> 00:11:55.300
Oh, yeah. There's this handsome
player with a tan on your team, right?

00:11:56.020 --> 00:11:57.190
You mean Anita?

00:11:57.190 --> 00:12:00.550
No, that's your tomboy friend!

00:12:00.550 --> 00:12:02.150
I'm talking about a boy! A <i>boy</i>!

00:12:02.380 --> 00:12:04.980
Oh, you mean Nishina?

00:12:04.980 --> 00:12:07.120
I'm not sure I'd call him handsome, though.

00:12:07.640 --> 00:12:09.690
What about him?

00:12:09.690 --> 00:12:12.080
O-Oh, nothing.

00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:21.550
<i>Nishina-kun, huh?</i>

00:12:22.150 --> 00:12:25.800
No girl on the planet likes being called big.

00:12:26.450 --> 00:12:28.770
<i>Unlike that irritating captain,</i>

00:12:30.360 --> 00:12:32.270
<i>he was kind and handsome.</i>

00:12:35.270 --> 00:12:39.940
<i>Anyway, I knew Chisato
never really understood...</i>

00:12:41.080 --> 00:12:44.570
<i>...why I ended up quitting baseball.</i>

00:12:46.770 --> 00:12:48.910
All right, bring it!

00:12:58.190 --> 00:12:59.510
He's good!

00:12:59.510 --> 00:13:01.540
Ya can tell he got in on a baseball ticket.

00:13:01.540 --> 00:13:03.810
We've got ourselves a player.

00:13:03.810 --> 00:13:06.340
All right, we'll do some batting next!

00:13:06.580 --> 00:13:08.100
Got it!

00:13:08.100 --> 00:13:10.390
Chiba, did you improve again?

00:13:11.080 --> 00:13:12.350
You betcha.

00:13:12.730 --> 00:13:15.400
But if you got hung out to dry,

00:13:15.400 --> 00:13:18.060
the overall level in Senior 
League must be crazy high.

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:22.900
Oh, that? I wasn't benched
because I couldn't cut it.

00:13:23.160 --> 00:13:23.810
Huh?

00:13:24.290 --> 00:13:29.870
The coach there basically refuses to field
first-years, however good they are.

00:13:30.290 --> 00:13:34.680
But here, there's no annoying coach,
the level's not all that high,

00:13:34.680 --> 00:13:36.670
so it looks like I can just have fun.

00:13:42.700 --> 00:13:46.260
Uh, what? I expected Nishina 
to have taken your spot by now.

00:13:46.770 --> 00:13:50.450
Oh well. Feel free to try and
get me out with your best pitch.

00:13:51.290 --> 00:13:53.200
Wait, where's your helmet?

00:13:53.200 --> 00:13:54.070
Huh?

00:13:54.070 --> 00:13:56.940
I don't need one. I mean, it's a rubber ball.

00:13:57.450 --> 00:14:02.150
I played in Senior League where we used
 leather ones. This is like playing house.

00:14:04.080 --> 00:14:08.900
Amazin' how much half a year
of Senior League can bloat an ego.

00:14:08.900 --> 00:14:11.580
Kids that age are like that.

00:14:11.970 --> 00:14:14.540
<i>This first-year's just
as arrogant as last time.</i>

00:14:15.020 --> 00:14:17.120
<i>I don't really want him on the team.</i>

00:14:21.640 --> 00:14:24.950
H-Huh. Looks like it curves 
more than the last time I saw it.

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:27.010
Timeout.

00:14:27.930 --> 00:14:32.270
You can't do that, Mutsuko. You're meant to let
him hit it, not throw breaking balls at him.

00:14:33.700 --> 00:14:36.430
But he said to give him my best pitch.

00:14:36.430 --> 00:14:38.180
He's looking down on me.

00:14:38.180 --> 00:14:40.530
You can't let him provoke you!

00:14:40.530 --> 00:14:43.150
Officially, we're putting
him through his paces,

00:14:43.520 --> 00:14:48.690
but in reality, we just want him to
feel good so he joins the team for sure.

00:14:48.690 --> 00:14:50.860
Oh, right.

00:14:51.190 --> 00:14:53.080
What're they whisperin' 'bout?

00:14:53.080 --> 00:14:55.330
Probably telling her to humor him.

00:14:55.850 --> 00:14:58.830
<i>Fine, I'll let him hit it. Happy?!</i>

00:15:03.800 --> 00:15:10.580
Well, as you all saw,
he definitely doesn't lack for skill,

00:15:10.580 --> 00:15:15.180
so starting today, Chiba-kun
will officially be joining the team.

00:15:15.500 --> 00:15:18.540
I came here from the boring
sausage fest that was Senior

00:15:18.540 --> 00:15:22.010
because I was told this
team was a babe paradise.

00:15:22.010 --> 00:15:24.900
So I look forward to you all
cheering and swooning for me.

00:15:25.350 --> 00:15:26.800
That's sexual harassment!

00:15:26.800 --> 00:15:27.720
He called us babes.

00:15:27.720 --> 00:15:29.860
Oh, gosh, were you talking about <i>me</i>?

00:15:30.170 --> 00:15:33.570
<i>He totally looks down on all of us.</i>

00:15:33.800 --> 00:15:36.500
So, captain, what's my position?

00:15:36.500 --> 00:15:39.040
Oh, right. First's open at the moment,

00:15:39.260 --> 00:15:42.450
but let's keep the long-term
picture in mind and think it over.

00:15:42.450 --> 00:15:44.500
After all, you only just joined today.

00:15:44.500 --> 00:15:46.340
What is there to think about?

00:15:46.780 --> 00:15:49.080
You just saw how good I am.

00:15:49.080 --> 00:15:51.680
Yo, who's the shortstop?

00:15:51.880 --> 00:15:53.350
I am. Why?

00:15:53.350 --> 00:15:54.980
Oh, it's you?

00:15:54.980 --> 00:15:57.640
I remember seeing you in the spring.

00:15:57.930 --> 00:16:00.100
I remember thinking you were good for a girl.

00:16:00.300 --> 00:16:03.060
Emphasis on "for a girl."

00:16:05.020 --> 00:16:07.490
H-Hey now, what's got into you, Chiba?

00:16:07.490 --> 00:16:09.810
I thought you said you
just wanted to have fun.

00:16:09.810 --> 00:16:12.180
You saw how good my
defense was earlier, right?

00:16:12.180 --> 00:16:13.990
So you get it, don't you?

00:16:14.780 --> 00:16:17.950
You <i>will</i> let me play shortstop, won't you?

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:29.230
Dream on!

00:16:29.230 --> 00:16:34.700
Positions are something you take. You don't
get them without a fight, mushroom head!

00:16:34.700 --> 00:16:37.890
Take it from me if you can, mush for brains!

00:16:38.140 --> 00:16:40.440
Mushroom just got served!

00:16:44.850 --> 00:16:45.310
<b>Art Club</b>

00:16:44.850 --> 00:16:45.310
<b>Art Club</b>

00:16:45.310 --> 00:16:45.440
<b>Art Club</b>

00:16:45.310 --> 00:16:45.440
<b>Art Club</b>

00:16:45.440 --> 00:16:45.560
<b>Art Club</b>

