<b>Art Club</b>

00:16:57.120 --> 00:17:00.260
I'm so freakin' tired.

00:17:00.260 --> 00:17:03.810
You didn't tell me we had practice at 6:30.

00:17:03.810 --> 00:17:06.080
Seriously, what is this?

00:17:11.080 --> 00:17:15.480
Hey, Nishina, when did you get so serious?

00:17:15.480 --> 00:17:19.400
You used to be the one who always complained
about morning practice and stuff.

00:17:19.400 --> 00:17:20.810
You've changed.

00:17:22.200 --> 00:17:27.070
There's no scary coach or seniors there,
so nobody's gonna yell at you.

00:17:27.070 --> 00:17:28.400
Shut up!

00:17:28.400 --> 00:17:32.200
How will you get better at baseball
if you don't go to morning practice?!

00:17:33.250 --> 00:17:37.490
And anyway, doing stuff based on whether
someone's gonna yell at you or not?

00:17:37.490 --> 00:17:40.450
We're not babies anymore.
Stop being a waste of space.

00:17:42.450 --> 00:17:44.540
m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100

00:17:42.450 --> 00:17:44.540
m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100

00:17:42.450 --> 00:17:44.540
<b>Baseball Team</b>

00:17:42.450 --> 00:17:44.540
<b>Occupied</b>

00:17:43.260 --> 00:17:46.870
Oh yeah, Chisato, what
happened with yer sister?

00:17:48.150 --> 00:17:50.680
The captain said he ain't givin' up yet.

00:17:50.680 --> 00:17:52.530
S'there any chance she'll join?

00:17:53.230 --> 00:17:58.080
Nah. I mean, he said it's fine 
because we've got the mushroom now.

00:17:58.080 --> 00:17:59.130
What?

00:17:59.130 --> 00:18:01.040
What do you mean "What?"?

00:18:01.910 --> 00:18:03.140
Well, honestly...

00:18:03.140 --> 00:18:06.480
I don't care who joins, as long
as it ain't that dang mushroom.

00:18:06.780 --> 00:18:09.500
That freakin' mushroom thinks we're a joke!

00:18:09.500 --> 00:18:13.940
He pisses me off! I don't wanna
play baseball with a fella like that!

00:18:13.940 --> 00:18:17.590
Our captain ain't gonna say nothin'
'cause he ups the headcount, but—

00:18:15.100 --> 00:18:17.590
Wait, Chiba! It says occupied!

00:18:17.590 --> 00:18:18.700
Mornin!

00:18:20.050 --> 00:18:22.600
Whaddaya think yer doin'?!

00:18:34.780 --> 00:18:36.420
Chiba-kun, why are you walking?

00:18:36.420 --> 00:18:37.320
Run!

00:18:38.220 --> 00:18:39.300
I'm tired.

00:18:39.940 --> 00:18:43.490
Besides, my body doesn't function this early.

00:18:43.490 --> 00:18:47.310
And the leg she kicked earlier
for no reason hurts too.

00:18:47.310 --> 00:18:49.270
'Cause you were peepin' on us!

00:18:49.530 --> 00:18:53.230
And anyway, we can just do
this kind of training at home.

00:18:53.420 --> 00:18:55.160
Let's break out the balls.

00:18:55.160 --> 00:18:57.590
This is just like the
training they did at Senior.

00:18:57.590 --> 00:18:59.450
Quit your whining!

00:18:59.830 --> 00:19:02.660
We've been doing this routine forever.

00:19:02.980 --> 00:19:06.660
This doesn't even count as a warm-up for us.

00:19:06.660 --> 00:19:08.370
If you've got a problem, quit.

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:12.930
Whoa, whoa, whoa, hold up!

00:19:12.930 --> 00:19:17.600
Come on, it's only Chiba-kun's
second day. He's just not used to it yet.

00:19:17.600 --> 00:19:19.500
And it looks like his leg hurts.

00:19:19.500 --> 00:19:21.550
Anyway, that's the warm-up done!

00:19:21.550 --> 00:19:23.760
Let's do some fly ball practice!

00:19:29.320 --> 00:19:30.980
Next, shortstop!

00:19:38.920 --> 00:19:40.400
Bring it!

00:19:40.650 --> 00:19:42.110
This is nothing!

00:19:42.350 --> 00:19:44.480
They're both good.

00:19:45.230 --> 00:19:47.580
It's hard to say who's better.

00:19:47.580 --> 00:19:49.790
<b>Year 2 Class C</b>

00:19:47.580 --> 00:19:49.790
<b>Year 2 Class C</b>

00:19:48.520 --> 00:19:49.790
Hey, Daigo.

00:19:50.810 --> 00:19:52.870
About Chiba-kun...

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:56.620
I know we're in a weak position, but aren't 
you letting him get away with too much?

00:19:56.620 --> 00:19:57.340
What?

00:19:57.560 --> 00:20:01.800
I mean, it's true he's plugging a gap,
 and I'm grateful he's doing that...

00:20:02.220 --> 00:20:06.510
But when he disrupts the team's energy like
he did this morning, you have to tell him off.

00:20:06.760 --> 00:20:09.550
Tao stepped in this morning,

00:20:09.550 --> 00:20:12.520
but it should really be
the captain who does it.

00:20:12.520 --> 00:20:15.360
Basically, he thinks we're a joke!

00:20:16.920 --> 00:20:21.210
Yeah, but if I annoy him so much he quits
right after joining, that wouldn't be good.

00:20:22.090 --> 00:20:24.900
He still has his pride from Senior,

00:20:24.900 --> 00:20:27.700
so we should just let that 
kind of statement slide.

00:20:27.700 --> 00:20:29.040
What?!

00:20:29.590 --> 00:20:34.350
Besides, thanks to Chiba-kun's 
provocative style,

00:20:34.350 --> 00:20:36.960
Tao's more motivated than ever.

00:20:38.270 --> 00:20:40.580
It's good to have some stimulation, you know?

00:20:40.580 --> 00:20:43.420
Harmony alone does not a team make.

00:20:45.070 --> 00:20:46.090
Shigeno-kun.

00:20:47.150 --> 00:20:49.280
Y-Yamaguchi-sensei.

00:20:49.280 --> 00:20:51.750
I forgot to give you this.

00:20:52.340 --> 00:20:55.200
Oh, the list of practice 
games I asked you about!

00:20:55.810 --> 00:20:58.770
Thank you! So how did it go?

00:20:59.120 --> 00:21:02.150
It was a bust, to be honest. Lots of refusals.

00:21:02.150 --> 00:21:03.740
Oh, I see.

00:21:04.300 --> 00:21:05.760
<i>I guess that makes sense.</i>

00:21:05.760 --> 00:21:09.950
<i>I limited it to strong schools this time,
knowing they'd probably say no.</i>

00:21:10.320 --> 00:21:13.660
But there was one school
that agreed to a game.

00:21:15.620 --> 00:21:18.580
Tsujidou Academy Middle School

00:21:15.620 --> 00:21:18.580
Tsujidou Academy Middle School

00:21:15.850 --> 00:21:18.580
Tsujidou Middle accepted!

00:21:21.910 --> 00:21:24.260
That mushroom pisses me off so much!

00:21:24.640 --> 00:21:26.320
You're holding a grudge, huh?

00:21:26.320 --> 00:21:27.220
'Course I am!

00:21:27.630 --> 00:21:30.430
He almost saw us changin'!

00:21:30.430 --> 00:21:33.680
I bet he opened the door knowin' the
occupied sign meant we were in there.

00:21:34.300 --> 00:21:37.320
We seriously need to get some more players.

00:21:37.320 --> 00:21:41.650
If only we had someone else, we wouldn't
hafta suck up to that sucker.

00:21:43.420 --> 00:21:45.070
Chiyo?

00:21:45.390 --> 00:21:47.280
Huh? That's yer sister?

00:21:47.580 --> 00:21:48.740
Chiyo!

00:21:49.940 --> 00:21:52.930
What are you doing here?
This is the first-years' floor.

00:21:52.930 --> 00:21:57.310
Oh, uh, nothing. I was just passing through.

00:21:57.310 --> 00:21:59.550
Huh? Chiyo!

00:22:00.520 --> 00:22:02.130
Hey, over here!

00:22:03.350 --> 00:22:04.510
Got it! Watch this!

00:22:05.310 --> 00:22:06.550
Nice shot!

00:22:06.870 --> 00:22:08.010
Oh, I get it now.

00:22:08.980 --> 00:22:11.720
Chiyo likes Nishina.

