Ding!

00:22:17.420 --> 00:22:20.980
Anita, I just had a great idea!

00:22:20.980 --> 00:22:21.480
Huh?

00:22:21.980 --> 00:22:26.430
Chiyo might just join the
baseball team, after all.

00:24:00.360 --> 00:24:04.380
Ah, what a surprise! My sister 
might be joining the baseball team!

00:24:04.380 --> 00:24:05.620
What will you do, Nishina?

00:24:05.620 --> 00:24:07.460
It has nothing to do with me.

00:24:07.460 --> 00:24:11.670
Besides, we have to focus on our practice 
game with the powerhouse known as Tsujidou.

00:24:11.840 --> 00:24:15.550
Oh, wow! My sister's even
going to play in a game!

00:24:15.550 --> 00:24:17.700
Maybe she'll try hard for a certain someone!

00:24:17.700 --> 00:24:20.450
F-For real? Who's the certain someone?

